abstract: >-
  Readable, validated Python for chemical engineering thermodynamics - IAPWS-IF97 steam tables, power and
  refrigeration cycles, equations of state, phase and reaction equilibria - checked against reference
  formulations, independent implementations and textbook examples, with an 18-notebook course and worked
  solutions.
